var e={title:`Third Floor, Back Section`,slots:[{id:`A1`,take:`magazine`,img:`assets/img/vending/magazine.webp`,name:`ADDED VALUE`,sub:`Issue 1`,price:`€4.90`},{id:`A2`,take:`magazine`,img:`assets/img/vending/magazine.webp`,name:`ADDED VALUE`,sub:`Issue 1`,price:`€4.90`},{id:`A3`,text:`empty since the refit`},{id:`A4`,text:`One piece of chewing gum. Sideways. Out of reach.`},{id:`B1`,take:`magazine`,img:`assets/img/vending/magazine.webp`,name:`ADDED VALUE`,sub:`Issue 1`,price:`€2.45`,was:`€4.90`},{id:`B2`,text:`Price tag: DM 1.20`},{id:`B3`,take:`printout`,img:`assets/img/vending/printout.webp`,name:`Mindful Workspace`,sub:`Print edition`,price:`free`},{id:`B4`,text:`A coil with nothing on it. Turns anyway.`},{id:`C1`,text:`empty`},{id:`C2`,text:`A note: 'OUT OF ORDER'. Behind it: nothing.`},{id:`C3`,text:`empty`},{id:`C4`,take:`c4`,sub:`stuck`,text:`Something is lying at the back. No telling what shape.`}],plate:[{label:`TYPE`,value:`SV-2200, 48 SLOTS`},{label:`LAST SERVICE`,value:`11/2009`},{label:`NEXT SERVICE`,value:`ON REQUEST`},{label:`POWER`,value:`— — —`}],plug:`The plug is lying next to it.`,crank:[{ms:0,text:`You reach through the flap and get hold of the coil. It is cold and greasy.`},{ms:600,text:`First turn. Far at the back, something moves.`},{ms:800,text:`Second. The light above you flickers in time with it. That is a coincidence.`},{ms:1e3,text:`Third. Nothing.`},{ms:1200,text:`Fourth. Somewhere downstairs, a lift sets off.`},{ms:1300,text:`Fifth. You wonder whether it is possible to sleep standing up.`},{ms:1400,text:`Sixth. You count out loud, because nobody else is going to.`},{ms:1500,text:`Seventh. By now you know this coil better than most of your colleagues.`},{ms:1600,text:`Eighth. In your head, Kevin says: 'Welcome to the club.'`},{ms:2300,text:`Ninth. You glance at the window and are surprised that it is still light.`},{ms:600,text:`Tenth. Something tips.`},{ms:500,text:`Eleventh. It comes loose.`}],crankEnd:[{ms:700,text:`The light above you stops flickering. It is watching too.`},{ms:900,text:`It hits the glass, turns once and catches on the edge by one corner.`},{ms:1e3,text:`It wobbles. Slides a little. Catches again.`},{ms:900,text:`Then a dull thud in the flap.`,lands:!0},{ms:900,text:`Behind you the lift doors open. The lift from before. It has only just got up here.`},{ms:1200,text:`In the flap lies a filled roll, shrink-wrapped. The label says 'Best before:', and after it somebody has written 'yes' by hand.`}],crankFull:`Your backpack is full. The roll stays in the flap, for the next member of the club.`,magazine:{heading:`ADDED VALUE, Issue 1`,drop:`One turn, and the front copy drops. It had been leaning against the glass for quite a while.`,cover:{title:`ADDED VALUE`,tagline:`The Management Magazine`,issue:`Issue 1`,price:`€4.90`,lead:`The Year of Efficiency`,lines:[`Dr Wichtig on going without, and why it starts with you. pp. 4–31`,`'The Agile Kitchen': 14 pages of salad`,`Survey: what does synergy mean to you? p. 36`,`Portrait: the printer on the second floor`]},pages:[{head:`Editorial`,text:`Dear colleagues, you are holding the first issue of ADDED VALUE. That pleases me, because it means you have invested €4.90 in your own company. That is exactly the attitude we need. From the next issue on, ADDED VALUE will appear quarterly.`,sign:`Dr Wichtig, CEO`},{head:`Page 36: What does synergy mean to you?`,text:`This page has intentionally been left blank.`,blank:!0},{head:`Letters`,text:`We received no letters about this issue. We take that as agreement.`}],imprint:{head:`Imprint`,rows:[{label:`Publisher`,value:`Dr Wichtig, CEO`},{label:`Editorial office`,value:`Office of the CEO`},{label:`Frequency`,value:`quarterly`},{label:`Print run`,value:`2,000`},{label:`Copies sold`,value:`0`,zero:!0},{label:`Distribution`,value:`Vending machine SV-2200, third floor`}]},after:`You put the magazine on the windowsill. Eleven others are already lying there, all open at page 36.`},printout:{heading:`Mindful Workspace, print edition`,drop:`One turn. The printout slides out, stapled at one corner. The paper has the colour paper turns when it has been lying somewhere for a long time.`,title:`Mindful Workspace`,subtitle:`Now in a version you can touch! By popular demand.`,pen:`Thank you for the idea, dear Ms Kowalski! ♡`,posts:[{title:`New to the team: Kevin!`,emoji:`🎉`,when:`Posted 5 weeks ago`,text:`Say hello to our new apprentice! Kevin is still a little shy, but he has already asked where the server room is. I think he is going to feel right at home here.`},{title:`Coming soon: our wellbeing corner on the third floor`,emoji:`🕯️`,when:`Posted 6 weeks ago`,text:`At the back by the stairwell, a place to breathe is taking shape: warm, dimmed lighting, a bench and a vending machine with healthy snacks. Facilities is in the loop!`},{title:`Pilot project 'Silent Sync': who is in?`,emoji:`🤫`,when:`Posted 7 weeks ago`,text:`One hour of silence together, no agenda at all. Sign up with me, out loud is fine too!`}],signoff:`In deep connection with your KPIs, Your Chantal`,signoffEmoji:`💕`,comments:`Comments (0)`,after:`You push the printout back into the compartment. Right at the back there is another one, with a sticky note: 'For Ms Kowalski'.`},rules:{title:`House Rules C4`,list:[`Do not ask who restocks it.`,`No more than one.`,`Push the flap shut again. All the way shut.`,`The light stays broken. That is not neglect, that is camouflage.`,`Anyone who repairs the machine is out. Out of the club, not out of the company.`],limitRule:1,lead:`Signed so far:`,members:[`K. (Apprentice)`,`R. S. (Accounts)`,`G.`,`'The gentleman from the night shift'`,`E.`],you:`Miller (IT)`,free:`— — —`}};export{e as vending};